<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8106] In control.sh -active, exception will be eaten and not displayed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8106</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Here is the relevant code from GridChangeStateCommandHandler:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
            sb.a(e.getMessage()).a(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;\n&quot;&lt;/span&gt;).a(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;suppressed: \n&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);

            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (Throwable t:e.getSuppressed())
                sb.a(t.getMessage()).a(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;\n&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, before that code the exception will pass through IgniteUtils.convertException(), which will wrap the old IgniteCheckedException with suppressed parts with a new IgniteException with 0 suppressed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
